@startuml US_3_1_2_C4_Processos
title US 3.1.2 - Processo de renderização do layout

actor User
participant Layout as "LayoutComponent"
participant Auth as "AuthService"

User -> Layout: request page
Layout -> Auth: obter user + role
Layout -> Layout: render Header (logo, lang, user)
Layout -> Layout: render Nav (menu filtrado)
Layout -> Layout: render breadcrumbs + conteúdo
Layout -> User: layout consistente em todas as páginas

@enduml
